            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugisukekw amavuta ya elayo, mukigerekeko n’imibavu: iryo rizoba ishikanwa ry’ivyakozwe mw ifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuherezi aheze akūre kuri ryo ikizoba icibutso caryo, acōse, ni co gace k’ico gihonde c’impeke, n’ak’ ayo mavuta yazo, bo n’iyo mibavu yazo yose; iryo rizoba ishikanwa nshikaniwe jewe Uhoraho ritōngōrwa n’umuriro.",
